      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 700 240\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect width=\"700\" height=\"240\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <rect x=\"15\" y=\"10\" width=\"670\" height=\"25\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#334155\"/>\n  <text x=\"25\" y=\"27\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">PRODUCTION RELIABILITY: AGENT SLA DASHBOARD &amp; ERROR BUDGET TRACKING</text>\n  <rect x=\"525\" y=\"14\" width=\"150\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#065f46\"/>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"26\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">SLO DASHBOARD</text>\n\n  <!-- 4 KPI Grid Cards -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(15, 45)\">\n    <!-- KPI 1 -->\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"155\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n    <text x=\"12\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">AUTONOMOUS SUCCESS</text>\n    <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"800\" font-family=\"monospace\">94.2%</text>\n    <text x=\"12\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">Target: &gt; 90.0% · Healthy &check;</text>\n\n    <!-- KPI 2 -->\n    <rect x=\"170\" y=\"0\" width=\"155\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n    <text x=\"182\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">MEAN TURNS (MTTR)</text>\n    <text x=\"182\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"800\" font-family=\"monospace\">6.4</text>\n    <text x=\"182\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">Target: &lt; 8.0 turns · Optimal</text>\n\n    <!-- KPI 3 -->\n    <rect x=\"340\" y=\"0\" width=\"155\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#818cf8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n    <text x=\"352\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">PROMPT CACHE HIT</text>\n    <text x=\"352\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#818cf8\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"800\" font-family=\"monospace\">85.4%</text>\n    <text x=\"352\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#c7d2fe\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">-82% TTFT latency savings</text>\n\n    <!-- KPI 4 -->\n    <rect x=\"510\" y=\"0\" width=\"160\" height=\"80\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n    <text x=\"522\" y=\"18\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">DOOM-LOOP RATE</text>\n    <text x=\"522\" y=\"44\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"800\" font-family=\"monospace\">0.14%</text>\n    <text x=\"522\" y=\"60\" fill=\"#fde68a\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">Target: &lt; 0.5% · Low churn</text>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Bottom Error Budget Progress -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(15, 138)\">\n    <rect width=\"670\" height=\"82\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#111c33\" stroke=\"#334155\"/>\n    <text x=\"14\" y=\"20\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">30-Day Rolling Error Budget Status (SLO Target: 99.0% Availability):</text>\n\n    <!-- Progress Bar -->\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"640\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\"/>\n    <rect x=\"14\" y=\"30\" width=\"473\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n    <text x=\"240\" y=\"46\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">74.0% ERROR BUDGET REMAINING (HEALTHY)</text>\n\n    <text x=\"14\" y=\"70\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\">&check; Current Fleet Health: 99.74% · Deployments &amp; Model Upgrades UNBLOCKED</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "Enterprise agent SLAs monitor autonomous task resolution rates, mean turns to completion, prompt cache efficiency, and error budget burn, providing quantitative guardrails for agent reliability in production.",
      "captionEn": "Enterprise agent SLAs monitor autonomous task resolution rates, mean turns to completion, prompt cache efficiency, and error budget burn, providing quantitative guardrails for agent reliability in production."
